            "notes": "## **First round, easy build**\n\nPick  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) because you sure want to escape after reviving a teammate. This will help you with a lil valk for about 4 seconds, so you can fly away faster and sometimes without needing someone nearby.\n\nPut  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) to have a bit of weapon power and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to speed up heals.\n\nThen, go to *Survival* and take  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) so you will regenerate your own life faster.\n\nAnd that's all for first round, cya later! \u2728\u2728\u2728",
