            "notes": "## **Second round, things are getting interesting**\n\n**I usually sell everything and then buy again what I need more, because I want to see how much cash I own before buying.**\n\nImmediatly go to *Survival* and take **the one and only**  [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0). You might ask: \"Why should I take it?\" Because **you want to fly FAST**. Imagine Soldier-76, ok? He's aimbotted, he has aimbot even when he poops to center the toilet because he can't live without aimbotting everything, ok? With this and a bit of *ability power* you will fly everywhere and the enemy won't notice it. Need a bit of practice because in the first two rounds you need to play the passive Mercy, but no worries: things will change later.\n\nSo, go to *Ability*, put  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418).\n\nAfter that, go to *Weapon* and put  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) to have more weapon power for your heals and mantain  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) for the speed.\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTE**:\nIf you don't have enough cash to buy these items, I've put as optional the  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) item which gives you weapon power and *cooldown reduction*, or you can take again the classic  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) which costs only 1k.\n\nBe ready for 3rd round! \ud83d\ude0e",
