            "notes": "## **IT'S GETTING EVEN BETTER**!\n\n**Sell every item you bought before EXCEPT for [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0).**\n\nIn *Ability* the first thing to buy is:  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) which gives cooldown reduction but the best thing is that you can resurrect far from the fallen body, it works also mid-air and most of the time enemies don't understand it, so with the power of the  [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0) you can be very quick to fly there, revive and fly away with the mini-Valk!\n\nOther things to re-buy:  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) ,  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) in *Weapon*,  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) in *Ability*.\n\n**INFORMATIONS**: Again, depending on the match and on how much cash you have, you may want to sell the  [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0) to complete this part of build, you can take it again in the next round.\nGave you two optional things to swap the  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0).",
