            "notes": "## **TIME FOR 3RD POWER**!\n\n [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) \nLet your Caduceus Staff being chained for 3s to the previous ally you targetted, so that you can heal or boost both of them at the same time, even if for few.\n*With this power, you can easy build the ult*.\n \n**Sell every item you bought before EXCEPT for  [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0) and  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f)**\n\nIn *Weapon* buy  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) to have weapon power, but especially to have more range for the staff, so while you fly even if not near your allies, you can heal or boost them, really helpful when you have to stay in cover! \nBuy also:  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and the  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).\n\nIn *Ability* take the  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) for the 5% of ability power and the attack speed.\n\n**REMINDER**: Keep the  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) and the  [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0) in your build.\n\n [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0) works with AP, don't forget it! Even if you only have 5% is better than not to have it!\n\n**OPTIONAL**:  If you have more cash to spend, take some of the optional items, especially for attack speed.",
